{"id":"en_i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter","title":"I Refuse to Be Your Wife, Mr. Carter","titleEn":"I Refuse to Be Your Wife, Mr. Carter","description":"Evelyn devotes herself to nursing her paralyzed fiancé Julian back to health, yet once he recovers he turns on her. He tears down the medical legacy left by her mother and shatters Evelyn's hand on behalf of his mistress. Evelyn then reveals that the mistress's pregnancy is a lie, a disclosure that leaves Julian disgraced and paralyzed once more, able only to observe as Evelyn rebuilds her life and climbs again.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["All-Too-Late","Karma Payback","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dceb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dceb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dceb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dceb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-refuse-to-be-your-wife-mr-carter_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dceb8/?pub=4occak","kind":